  "business_impact": "The introduction of a secure sign-in page for MapleSure's licensed group-benefits advisors will allow direct, online access to the Advisor Portal, replacing the inefficient phone and email interactions. This initiative aims to streamline advisor activities, reduce re-keying errors, and establish the foundational infrastructure for future feature expansions.",
